t_uuid":"f2b64479-a7fb-4c52-9770-3ebd77207e3f","position":{"commit_sha":"b168398973e2067ac37e9b992f20a2f8deba6d57","position":"1794267521658863001-f2b64479-a7fb-4c52-9770-3ebd77207e3f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"824f1af33633ecd45901f20812cd736dbe64e2ce4f0c1826c95fabb8c87ee321","event_uuid":"ce057a51-b56a-44b9-ad76-2d187ed3c9d5","position":{"commit_sha":"b168398973e2067ac37e9b992f20a2f8deba6d57","position":"1794267531119595001-ce057a51-b56a-44b9-ad76-2d187ed3c9d5"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"55fa4f1c77877dec6bf53d24102fbd908458c36fb7bbc11be8cf6aeffebff8bf","event_uuid":"8f560968-8921-4a7f-85c8-a91b78b224b0","position":{"commit_sha":"33b2615600d78f89aee3e7bf9859a545c2d6b309","position":"1794267599942000001-8f560968-8921-4a7f-85c8-a91b78b224b0"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-308_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"a85e3cd3-9e61-4f25-9de4-cd740e853b4d","comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Finding (2026-11-09 15:45 PST): a spec's top-level `model:` key does not select the model a live `run_eval` uses. It is read only at `src/rebar/llm/evals/eval.py:308` and passed to `validate_scorer` to enforce grader/generator separation; the live run resolves its model through the configured classes (`rebar.toml`). So the before/after prompt-eval comparison is controlled by the upgrade commit (5c89609a0aa, `beaten-natural-grouse`), not by this change. This change keeps the pins truthful. Committed as c984cedba41, stacked on 5c89609a0aa: 28 specs, `model:` line only. Strict validation unchanged (code-quality, gold-only, fails identically on origin/main). Before run (4.x, origin/main 872e7f6c3fd, gate-wrapped, REBAR_EVAL_MAX_CASES=12, 12:33 to 14:45 PST) is recorded; the after run follows on the stacked tree.","timestamp":1794267599942000001}],"created_at":1794256006727331001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"69837cc0-e5ff-4d47-b7e9-9d9721a3b036","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"7341-7f22-b13a-442c"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nEach prompt-eval spec in `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/*.eval.yaml` pins the model it generates with in a top-level `model:` key (for example `plan-review-finder.eval.yaml:11` is `anthropic:claude-opus-4-8`; `plan-review-evidence-kind.eval.yaml:5` is `bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6`), read by `rebar.llm.evals.eval` at `eval.py:308` (`gen_model = spec.get(\"model\")`). After the configured models move to the 5.5 generation (sibling task `beaten-natural-grouse`), these pins would keep the prompt evals measuring the retired models, so the evals could not show whether the prompts still pass on the models that actually run.\n\n## Approach\n\nMove every spec pin to the 5.5 id of the same family and provider, keeping the provider each spec names: `anthropic:claude-opus-4-8` to `anthropic:claude-opus-5-5`, `anthropic:claude-sonnet-4-6` to `anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5`, `bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6` to `bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5-5`, and any Haiku pin to `claude-haiku-5-5`. Run the prompt evals the `eval-live` job defines (`.github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml`: `rebar.llm.evals.eval.run_eval` over each dataset-bearing spec at `REBAR_EVAL_MAX_CASES=12`) once on the 4.x pins before the change and once on the 5.5 pins after, with `AWS_PROFILE=frontier-bedrock`, and record both summaries (spec, pass/fail, coverage) as a ticket comment. The commit is stacked on the upgrade task's commit (Gerrit parent), so it cannot land first, and the after-run is made on that stack because the 5.5 request-surface fixes (no temperature, explicit effort, corrected profile) must be in place for it to be meaningful; a one-to-one family mapping keeps each spec measuring the same tier it was calibrated on.\n\n## Scope\n\n- src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/*.eval.yaml (the `model:` line of each spec that pins a 4.x model; no other line changes)\n\n## Testing\n\n- `tests/unit` eval-discipline checks (the offline tier `_eval-discipline.yml` runs) pass, so spec validation still accepts every edited file.\n- Live: the before and after prompt-eval runs described above.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `git grep -nE 'claude-(opus-4-8|sonnet-4-6|haiku-4-5)' -- src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/*.eval.yaml` prints nothing.\n- [ ] The before (4.x) and after (5.5) prompt-eval summaries are recorded in a ticket comment, one line per spec with pass/fail and coverage.\n- [ ] `make verify` exits 0.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-quality.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-api-compat.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-base.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-concurrency.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-db-migrations.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-docs.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-failover.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-llm-prompts.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-performance.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-security.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-tests.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-verify.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/completion-verifier.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-T10.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-T15.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-ac-process-gate.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-asserted-capability.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-container.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-decomp-shape.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-evidence-kind.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-finder.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-g7.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-isf-finder.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-necessity.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-no-file-impact.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-novelty.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-verifier.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/spec-alignment.eval.yaml","reason":"model pin to 5.5"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["parent","9794-4336-5ed6-4561"],["relates_to","7341-7f22-b13a-442c"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"9794-4336-5ed6-4561","parent_status_uuid":"f2b64479-a7fb-4c52-9770-3ebd77207e3f","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"81a1-0fc3-496d-4a00","ticket_type":"task","title":"Move prompt-eval spec model pins to the 5.5 ids and record before/after prompt evals","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a89e8dce-4943-4226-9018-cf289312b0aa","2e2065d5-16f6-45a1-b465-48a1dd08cb8e","69837cc0-e5ff-4d47-b7e9-9d9721a3b036","ff66622b-038b-4406-9027-7129d265d311","f2b64479-a7fb-4c52-9770-3ebd77207e3f","ce057a51-b56a-44b9-ad76-2d187ed3c9d5","8f560968-8921-4a7f-85c8-a91b78b224b0"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794267599942000002,"uuid":"daa91282-838a-4016-afb1-d1457fe36529"}